add('mughal','Mughal',['kashmir'],'community','Community label in the AJK directory',['Bagh','Muzaffarabad'],'Mughal is a named community entry in the project directory. The current record preserves its locality examples as research leads.','The directory alone does not establish Central Asian descent or a relationship to the imperial Mughal dynasty.',question='Find a specific AJK reference for the recorded identity and localities. Keep dynasty and family identity separate.')
add('awan','Awan',['kashmir'],'community','Community identity in the AJK directory',['Muzaffarabad','Hattian Bala','Bagh','Poonch'],'Awan appears in the project directory. Its AJK locality examples remain open for more specific sourcing.','A historic Punjab reference cannot by itself confirm these AJK examples or a claimed common ancestor.',context=book('Ibbetson includes Awan in his regional classification.','Part IV, section 465, Awan, Caste No 12'))
add('abbasi','Abbasi',['kashmir'],'title','Lineage identity in the project directory',['Bagh','Hattian Bala','Muzaffarabad'],'The AJK poster lists Abbasi. This record retains the supplied name without merging it with another community.','The name alone does not authenticate Abbasid descent. Any equivalence with Dhund needs local and source-specific support.',question='Check the intended local community, its name variants and any claimed relationship to Dhund.')
add('syed','Syed',['kashmir'],'title','Lineage identity in the project directory',['Bhimber'],'Syed is included in the project directory with Bhimber as an example locality. Family-level claims remain outside the evidence of this poster.','A lineage title alone does not prove the ancestry of a particular family. The Bhimber example needs its own reference.',question='Find a locality-specific source. Attribute any family genealogy to the evidence that records it.')
