 ('chauhan','Chauhan',['punjab'],['Attock','Chakwal','Jhelum'],'Rajput-associated in the project chart',[alias('Chohan')],book('Ibbetson discusses Chauhan among Rajput entries.','Part III, The Chauhan, No 2'),'Keep the historical category attributed. The project locality examples and the proposed emblem need separate documentation.'),
