 ('chibb','Chibb',['punjab','kashmir'],['Bhimber (AJK)','Gujrat (Punjab)','Sialkot (Punjab)'],'Rajput-associated in the project chart',[alias('Chib'),alias('Chibh','Historical source spelling','Ibbetson uses Chibh. Check the specific family and locality when connecting historical and modern spellings.')],book('Ibbetson includes a Chibh entry under Jammu-border Rajputs.','Part III, section 455, The Chibh, No 10'),'The historic entry reports origin claims. It does not establish the Katoch ancestry of every family using a related spelling.'),
 ('gakhar','Gakhar',['punjab'],['Rawalpindi','Hazara (outside current browsing scope)'],'Classification needs source-specific treatment',[alias('Gakkar'),alias('Gakkhar','Historical source spelling')],book('Ibbetson treats Gakkhar in a separate tribal entry.','Part IV, The Gakkhar entry'),'The project chart groups Gakhar with Rajput-associated names. That grouping does not settle its classification. Hazara is retained only as an out-of-scope poster example.'),
 ('minhas','Minhas',['punjab','kashmir'],['Mirpur (AJK)','Kotli (AJK)','Gujrat (Punjab)','Sialkot (Punjab)'],'Rajput-associated in the project chart',[alias('Manhas')],book('Ibbetson discusses Manhas among Jammu-border Rajputs.','Part III, section 455, The Manhas, No 9'),'Historical Manhas usage does not establish a universal equivalence for every Minhas family. Solar descent remains a tradition requiring attribution.'),
 ('naru','Naru',['punjab'],['Southern Punjab'],'Rajput-associated in the project chart',[alias('Narwa','Unconfirmed project label','The poster pairs Narwa with Naru. That relationship has not been independently verified.')],book('Ibbetson records Naru around Jalandhar and Hoshiarpur.','Part III, Naru entry preceding The Ghorewaha, No 13'),'The independent context concerns a different part of historical Punjab. The southern Punjab example and Narwa pairing need verification.'),
