 ('ranjha','Ranjha',['punjab'],['Mandi Bahauddin','Gujrat'],'Classification varies in the project chart',[],book('Ibbetson includes Ranjha under Rajput tribes of the Jhelum.','Part III, section 451, The Ranjha, No 9'),'A period-specific classification should not replace local family identification. These locality examples need contemporary or district-specific support.'),
 ('jasgam','Jasgam',['punjab'],['Rawalpindi','Islamabad'],'Rajput-associated in the project chart',[],None,'The spelling and classification currently come from the poster. No independent entry has been resolved here. A missing OCR match does not prove absence.'),
