 ('dogar','Dogar',['punjab'],['Faisalabad','Toba Tek Singh','Okara'],'Rajput association disputed in the project chart',[alias('Dogan','Unconfirmed project label','Dogan appears in the poster. It is not accepted here as a verified Dogar spelling.')],book('Ibbetson questions the Dogar Rajput-origin claim.','Part IV, Dogar entry'),'The ancestry claim remains disputed. The Dogan label and the listed modern locality examples require independent verification.')
